<tr nodeId="ae2aaa3ae4e54673b17b7591f41f814e">
<td colwidth="[749]" verticalAlign="top" bgColor="rgb(255, 255, 255)" nodeId="6a174801d46744a690c1dc2efdef850d">
<p nodeId="79fcaa8bc79e42019eab3f2bb0a167b0"><span font-size="14"><strong>【入口】</strong></span></p>
<p align="start" nodeId="b1d53f7d29a649b6a08743abc62216a0"><span font-size="14">Zeus--&gt;策略部署--&gt;画布</span></p>
<p nodeId="13c964de03194b92b29374356f3d4488"><span font-size="14"><strong>【基础配置】</strong></span></p>
<ol nodeId="74f60e31b91b4800bd9e1e3a15b27fbf">
<li nodeId="a807c84fc9814bc5ae7e1bfe4b18b23c"><span font-size="14">点击右上角「新建画布」，在弹框中按要求填写完成「画布中文名称」和「画布英文名称」并保存后，自动跳转到画布配置页面；</span></li>
<li nodeId="c8e0badd3ff84918b892fa33fc522f85"><span font-size="14">左侧为工具栏，涵盖画布配置所需的所有支持的组件；</span></li>
<li nodeId="de57fa8159634ce685e3cc592470e64b">
<p nodeId="71753d9e523845bf9370c3e01e05c0d4"><span font-size="14">将</span><span color=" "><span font-size="14">代码组件</span></span><span font-size="14">组件拖拽到画布中央，点击组件，右侧出现组件基本信息配置模块：</span></p>
<ol nodeId="200c876770544c8e8f377f538b59c6b9">
<li nodeId="d0005d9660d0476894f1bd4fe7894a08">
<p nodeId="eb950de17a8f43ceb52ca37f49c8343d"><span font-size="14">基本信息：</span></p>
<ol nodeId="20f40af136d9455ba0c5d984cd9e4406">
<li nodeId="fe6e9d2b8c4a4bd2bc4ee0da7414672c"><span font-size="14">名称：</span><span color=" "><span font-size="14">支持中英文，不超过10个字，填写后画布中央的组件名称会变更，必填</span></span></li>
</ol>
</li>
<li nodeId="09e2945827344f1ab652aaab916cd552">
<p nodeId="e2df6a9df9974bed806811491e621dd5"><span font-size="14">配置信息：</span></p>
<ol nodeId="da5dedbee3ed44d1aa88e42554a406b2">
<li nodeId="536eaeaf025a4141938cc7589168ffb0"><span font-size="14">可直接在代码块中填写java代码，在整个画布配置完成后，会对代码进行校验，非必填</span></li>
<li nodeId="f17a8496fc024b27baed48f165fe0396">
<p nodeId="6831dc677a9844fc8121fa6f0e028290"><span font-size="14">如果要实现“一进一出”的逻辑，则继承抽象类IProcessor，并实现process方法。</span></p>
<p nodeId="985d2b65d9514b14bc04a32848de5b63"><span font-size="14">如果要实现“一进多出”的逻辑，则继承抽象类IFlatProcessor，并实现flatProcess方法。</span></p>
<p nodeId="cfd602067d9c411a9802351d870bea6c"><span font-size="14">抽象类所在包为：</span></p>
<pre language="Plain Text" nodeId="5569f2b73b3a450d8e77cc5afa1bdf08"><code>&lt;dependency&gt;   
  &lt;groupId&gt;com.meituan.rc.zeus&lt;/groupId&gt;  
  &lt;artifactId&gt;zeus-dynamic-script&lt;/artifactId&gt; 
  &lt;version&gt;1.1.6-nearline&lt;/version&gt;
&lt;/dependency&gt;</code></pre>
<p nodeId="0fac51fa35564c2888054c4703273a4f"><span font-size="14">可以在本地引入上述依赖包并进行代码编写，正式配置时需要把类中所有代码(包括包名粘贴到代码块中)</span></p>
</li>
<li nodeId="8506d6f478b3473fa4d85c9e6dbfbc78">
<p nodeId="14d7639ba841429893c00ff9066a61cc"><span font-size="14">process方法入参为传入该组件的上下文，出参为经过该组件处理后的上下文。</span></p>
<p nodeId="70abd9224bd34d68be4fbb0341e5d9aa"><span font-size="14">flatProcess方法入参为传入该组件的上下文，出参为经过该组件处理后的多条上下文。</span></p>
</li>
<li nodeId="7ff64a3b34e84739ad2c2c62bc555846">
<p nodeId="c79c5a51b3be474c91bc91f3997f9b12"><span font-size="14">demo：</span></p>
<pre language="Plain Text" nodeId="d8e248d20b784a5c81b6daa8c72b29c7"><code>package com.meituan.rc.zeus.nearline.flink;

import com.meituan.rc.zeus.dynamic.script.runtime.IProcessor;

import java.util.Map;

public class DemoProcessor extends IProcessor {
    @Override
    public Map&lt;String, Object&gt; process(Map&lt;String, Object&gt; map) {
        String firstName = String.valueOf(map.get("firstName")); //从原始上下文中获取firstName字段并转为字符串型
        String lastName = String.valueOf(map.get("lastName")); //从原始上下文中获取lastName字段并转为字符串型
        map.put("fullName", firstName + " " + lastName); //将firstName和lastName拼接赋值给fullName
        return map; //将上下文返回
    }
}</code></pre>
<pre language="Plain Text" nodeId="c325e4327af44e1398c8c5b2a22ae363"><code>package com.meituan.rc.zeus.nearline.flink;

import com.google.common.collect.Lists;
import com.meituan.rc.zeus.dynamic.script.runtime.IFlatProcessor;
import org.apache.curator.shaded.com.google.common.collect.Maps;

import java.util.List;
import java.util.Map;

public class DemoFlatProcessor extends IFlatProcessor {
    @Override
    public List&lt;Map&lt;String, Object&gt;&gt; flatProcess(Map&lt;String, Object&gt; map) {
        List&lt;Map&lt;String,Object&gt;&gt; resultList = Lists.newArrayList();
        for (int i = 0; i &lt; 3; i ++) {
            resultList.add(Maps.newHashMap(map));
        }
        return resultList;
    }
}</code></pre>
